out 18%. The deployment history shows v2.3.1 and v2.3.1-rc as unhealthy. We rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent healthy release, in all production regions. After the rollback the service reports healthy, with an error rate of about 0.2%. Next steps: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 regression before deploying it again.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 44900, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01K6SBDNUdJrTjQ6zVGR18qR", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 44900, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01K6SBDNUdJrTjQ6zVGR18qR", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 46407, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01VrwLKLRKdE71r3q43oQc3N", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 46707, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01VrwLKLRKdE71r3q43oQc3N", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 46707, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01VrwLKLRKdE71r3q43oQc3N", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 50529, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01VkbiXgZwMz2gzJYLRuJbPb", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "After the latest deploy, checkout-api v2.3.1 failed health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), with an error rate of about 18%. 